sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy<br/>8081/TCP HTTP
    participant EPP as EPP (Endpoint Picker)<br/>9002/TCP gRPC
    participant vLLM_P as vLLM Prefill Pod<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant vLLM_D as vLLM Decode Pod<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant NIXL as NIXL KV Transfer<br/>5600/TCP RDMA
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 1: Standard Inference Request
    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP (no auth)
    Envoy->>EPP: ext_proc request<br/>gRPC (no encryption)
    Note right of EPP: Scores endpoints by<br/>prefix cache affinity<br/>and load
    EPP-->>Envoy: Selected endpoint address
    Envoy->>vLLM_P: Forward request (ORIGINAL_DST)<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP (no encryption)
    vLLM_P-->>Envoy: Inference response
    Envoy-->>Client: JSON response

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 2: Disaggregated Prefill/Decode Inference
    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP (no auth)
    Envoy->>EPP: ext_proc request<br/>gRPC (no encryption)
    Note right of EPP: Selects prefill pod<br/>token-load-scorer plugin
    EPP-->>Envoy: Selected prefill endpoint
    Envoy->>vLLM_P: Forward to prefill pod<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP
    Note over vLLM_P,NIXL: Prefill computes KV cache
    vLLM_P->>NIXL: KV cache transfer<br/>TCP/RDMA 5600/TCP (no encryption)
    NIXL->>vLLM_D: KV cache received
    Note over vLLM_D: Decode phase begins<br/>using transferred KV cache
    vLLM_D-->>Envoy: Streaming response<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP
    Envoy-->>Client: Streaming JSON response

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 3: Model Loading (Startup)
    vLLM_P->>HF: Download model weights<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer HF_TOKEN
    HF-->>vLLM_P: Model artifacts
    vLLM_D->>HF: Download model weights<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer HF_TOKEN
    HF-->>vLLM_D: Model artifacts
